// A movie palace: downtown's picture house, a lit marquee over the sidewalk ringed with chasing
// bulbs and a blade sign up its front. Grounded; the words on it are common nouns, never a
// name. Kit format: crates/world/src/landmarks.rs and docs/adr/0007-landmark-kits.md. Kit
// frame, m: x across the lot (to the right seen from the road), y up, z toward the road; the
// lot spans x -14..14 and z -44..0, the auditorium at the back, the lobby front at z -6 and
// the marquee out over the front of the lot.
Kit(
    id: "movie_palace",
    about: "A downtown movie palace with a marquee and a blade sign.",
    tone: Grounded,
    lot: (28.0, 44.0),
    ground: Some("pad"),
